        "api": 1,
        "source": "// A farm the bot works from a minecart. Wherever the server puts the bot\n// (a join, a lobby and back, a respawn), it gets into the nearest free\n// minecart first.\nfn on_join(first) {\n    if first {\n        state.swings = 0;\n    }\n    get_in();\n    timer.every(600, \"swing\");\n}\n\nfn on_world_change() {\n    get_in();\n}\n\nfn on_respawn() {\n    get_in();\n}\n\nfn on_timer(name) {\n    if name == \"get_in\" {\n        get_in();\n    } else if name == \"swing\" {\n        swing();\n    }\n}\n\n// Gets into the minecart, and looks again in a second until the bot is seated.\nfn get_in() {\n    if bot.riding {\n        return;\n    }\n    vehicle.mount(\"minecart\");\n    timer.after(1000, \"get_in\");\n}\n\n// One attack with the sword in slot 1, counted.\nfn swing() {\n    if !bot.riding {\n        return;\n    }\n    hotbar.select(1);\n    look.at(90.0, 0.0);\n    if mouse.left.tap().ok {\n        state.swings += 1;\n    }\n}\n",
